  "architecture": "Fresh spectral/periodic rejection CNN and separate convolutional 40-frame pitch-presence head conditioned on 163 physical context features. Removal requires both high rejection confidence and low presence at every one of the central 24 event samples. No inherited weights, fitted logits, reference labels, absolute pitch, filename or source identity as inference inputs.",
  "supervision": "Conservative note KEEP labels plus independent frame presence from supplied pitch-support intervals using the exact coarse-window clock. Half-hop boundary padding; promote any sub-frame supplied overlap to its nearest central sample, and preserve jittered attack/hold labels. Train-only normalization and corpus/recording weights. Weighted note cross-entropy and frame binary cross-entropy. All 88/24 authored NSynth fitting clips plus 16/4 public-domain Mutopia piano clips with newly measured recurrence. Original instrument/work partitions unchanged. No reserved clips fitted or labels guessed from audio.",
  "composition": "Compute deletion probability from complete V32 input. Run current V38 releases on complete unchanged input; apply deletion afterward. No onset, release, pitch or velocity edits for retained notes.",
  "validation_gate": "Every recording must preserve attacks, holds, pitch support, fixed-pair onset/release timing, repeated spacing, chord timing and unsupported duration. Positive overall false-note reduction and separately positive MusicNet real-piano gain at normal and stricter thresholds. Freeze one validation winner without any test use.",
  "subsequent_gate": "All 563 consumed regressions at both thresholds, followed by one independent 40-clip original/texture MP3 first pass with seeds 287101-287140 cycling 48/128/192 kbps and separately positive gain. Never fit consumed failures, retune, choose a runner-up or replace a first-pass clip after failure. Export, complete physical/runtime parity and native functional tests before website changes.",
  "no_user_audio_or_scores": true,
  "no_audio_inference": true,
  "new_weights_deployed": false
}
